GNOME Shell's theme sources, unmodified, from
https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-shell/-/tree/50.5/data/theme
(tag 50.5, commit dd8bec9326c2416e7b65b8bc9db4e62126a4fe8b), GPL-2.0-or-later.

jade/shelltheme.py compiles gnome-shell-dark.scss (gnome-shell-light.scss for light themes) with a few base color
variables pointed at the current Omarchy palette, then appends shell-theme/jade.scss.
